---
import { links } from "../data/projects";
---

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="shell about-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="about.eyebrow">THE APPROACH</p>
      <h2 id="about-title" data-i18n-html="about.title">Curiosity,<br /><em>with intent.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="about.lead">
        I care about how software is designed, how systems behave, and how technology can solve real operational problems.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.p1">
        My interests span software development, security research, automation, and independent product building.
        I value clear architecture, careful testing, honest documentation, and work that can be verified.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="about.p2">
        Through ETCHERO, I am working toward useful digital products, AI tools, and developer utilities.
        I am open to opportunities where I can contribute, learn quickly, and take responsibility for meaningful engineering work.
      </p>
      <div class="socials">
        <a href={links.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a href={links.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        <a href={links.etchero} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ETCHERO ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
